DESCRIPTION:A beginner-level volunteer shift at the community bike shop. Wo
 rking side by side on bikes makes it easy to talk with other volunteers.\n
 \nNov 14 is the only Saturday Beginner session posted in the window (statu
 s: Waiting List). None are posted for Dec 2026-Feb 2027.\n\nHow to join: S
 ign up or join the waitlist on durhambikecoop.corsizio.com\, and check bac
 k there for new Saturday Beginner dates.\n\nBefore you go: The Nov 14 sess
 ion is waitlisted. Watch corsizio for Dec-Feb dates\, which aren't posted 
 yet. No cost is shown.\n\nhttps://durhambikecoop.corsizio.com/\n\nListed o
 n Same Time Next Week.
